{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1300448-contagion-chronicle-dark-eras","id":1300448,"title":"Contagion Chronicle Dark Eras","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-03-27T19:03:14-07:00","id":1300448,"title":"Contagion Chronicle Dark Eras","content":"I.E. Historical settings for <b>Contagion Chronicle</b> meta-setting. What are yours ideas of Contagion past outbreaks? What interesting Dark Eras can be made for it?<br /> <br /> I'm <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1137216-dark-eras-fan-byzantine-empire?p=1274174#post1274174\">pivoting my Byzantine Empire Dark Eras fan setting to encompass Contagion</a> - when it's canon in <b>CC</b> that <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Plague_of_Justinian\" target=\"_blank\">Plague of Justinian (541\u2013542 AD)</a> was cementing event for creation of Jeremiad Sworn.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 03-27-2019, 11:00 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-27T20:27:57-07:00","id":1300460,"title":"","content":"My players have been headed to a tropical forest region for a while now and I've been beating around the bush regarding what to put in it. I settled on an idigam but it seemed like too much, and I wanted more of a force than a big monster (there's other antagonist groups that are like that) so I'm hoping the Contagion gives me some ideas for it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-27T22:46:00-07:00","id":1300472,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar886_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"886\" data-vbnamecard=\"886\">nofather</a>, but what's a context of their journey to tropical forest? Why, when, what Era?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-28T09:30:27-07:00","id":1300567,"title":"","content":"It's a fantasy setting, not a real one, the region is roughly equivalent to 1200s India with werewolves, mostly Ivory Claws dominating the equivalent of the Kshatriya caste. While part of the reason is going there to escape a massive hunt led by the Ivory Claws (the jungled region is out of their control, and they are less likely to follow there), the other is to settle some personal issues of the characters.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.co